5,1,1,talk,Yumi,,Let’s start by looking at the winter road closures and the bus links in the outer wards.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,I’d like to check the two programmes begun six years ago and the volunteer register.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shion,,I’ll examine the county grant terms and the running and equipment lines from last year.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Minako,,I’ll look into the evening room bookings and the attendance sheets from former outreach stops.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I’ll check the quoted delivery windows and the neighbourhood associations.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Benjamin, do you think the volunteer register will show if we actually have the skills for new programs?","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"It lists who is there, not what they can do. I’m checking the six-year-old records to see what actually survived.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Yumi, road closures are a fact, not a variable. I’m checking the grant terms to see if the funding structure holds up.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Minako,,"@Shion, I’m checking the attendance sheets to see if demand actually exists where we think it does.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Minako, I’m checking delivery windows to see if our timelines depend on suppliers we can’t control.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Yumi,,"@Daisuke, that’s exactly my worry. If suppliers slip, our whole schedule collapses. I hope the data shows we can plan around it.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@Yumi, I’m looking for the same thing. If the old records show what failed, we won’t repeat it.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Shion,,"@Benjamin, records are just paper. I’m checking the grant terms to see if the money actually lasts beyond the first year.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Minako,,"@Shion, I’m checking the evening bookings to see if our current hours already match when people actually want to use us.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,"@Shion, I’m checking the neighbourhood associations to see if they can sustain the work without us.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Yumi,,"I’m hoping the road closure data shows we can plan around the weather, not just react to it.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,"I’m hoping the old records show which formats actually stuck, so we stop reinventing the wheel.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Shion,,I’m hoping the grant terms reveal whether the funding structure collapses the moment the initial contract expires.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
