35,2,1,talk,Yumi,,"@Benjamin, the old records show the partner-run groups still meet unaided, but the digitisation batch left half its images unindexed.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,"@Yumi, that confirms my suspicion. We keep proposing things that look like the digitisation batch, which quietly failed.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Shion,,"@Benjamin, interesting. But my grant data shows the real trap is the twelve-month cliff, not the project type.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Minako,,"@Shion, the attendance sheets show forty visitors per session in the outer wards, far exceeding midweek main branch numbers.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,"@Minako, that demand is real, but my delivery data shows suppliers slip whenever bigger clients book first.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Yumi,,"- **Yumi**: @Daisuke, that’s terrifying. But my road closure data shows the halls kept their timetapes even when roads shut.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Yumi, that’s a good point. But my volunteer register shows no one on payroll is trained to supervise outside facilitators.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Shion,,"@Benjamin, that’s a staffing gap, not a funding one. My ledger shows the vehicle line overran by a third, so we can’t afford extra staff.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Minako,,"@Shion, the vehicle overrun is a warning, but the attendance data proves the demand is there. We just need the right structure.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Minako"",""self"":true,""raw"":""Minako: @Shion, the vehicle overrun is a warning, but the attendance data proves the demand is there. We just need the right structure.""}]}"
